{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119544","id":3701770186,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7cpIfK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119544","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119544.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119544.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119544","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119544/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119544/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119544/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/995cf1dca4ee90daadaaeebdebd1df2b056ee192","number":119544,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix crash when reimporting an open scene whose tab index becomes stale","user":{"login":"nklbdev","id":7024016,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQwMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7024016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/nklbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nklbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\r\n\r\nWhen reimporting an imported scene (e.g. a `.gltf` file) while its\r\ngenerated `.scn` is open in a tab, the editor crashes with:\r\n\r\n    ERROR: Index p_idx = 2 is out of bounds (edited_scene.size() = 2)\r\n    FATAL: get() out of bounds\r\n\r\nThe old scene tab is removed before the new one is added — a confirmation\r\ndialog (\"Open Anyway?\") may appear in between — making the stored index stale.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nStore the scene *path* instead of its *index* across the reload cycle,\r\nand resolve the index at the point of use. Two methods fixed:\r\n\r\n- `_reload_modified_scenes()` — store current path, resolve after loop\r\n- `reload_scene()` — resolve new index by path after `load_scene`\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-05-18T12:15:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T13:20:36Z","closed_at":"2026-09-13T13:20:27Z","merged_at":null,"mer